DJMax Randomizer changelog
3.0

- Fix: Excludebox better key handling and key was hardcoded to 'F4'
- Fix: Racecondition with hotkey functions. chartsmemdb was probably messed up because of this.
		Should this still not work, a full fix would be to en/disable other hotkeys while run.
- Megingjord added to songlist.
- UI:
	- Fix: Rendering issues fixed in Stats. Now should correctly update values.
	- New: Due to Megingjord being a hidden song there is now a checkbox for it
		   alongside other songs with special unlock conditions under [DLC].

v2.9
ToDo:
-Longer playsessions with exclude charts somehow mess up the memory db. It rolled 8k HD for A[UE]OON despite NM not cleared.
		-> Idea: Output whole database into file (charts object?)

- UI improvements:
	+ Filter options now only updated when changes from owning DLC is registered
	+ Stats will now show accumulated changes for the current session
- Added all missing DLC data for Dungeon&Fighter, VL4/VL5, O.N.G.E.K.I., PLI packs and free RV songs converted from Season Pass
- Hundreds of difficulty changes are now included (+ new SC difficulties).
- Code optimizations:
	+ Sorting function overhaul
	+ Debugging vars added
	+ Recording functions improved and compatible with all DLC, now easier to implement new DLC
- Fix: Same name songs are now unique to circumvent unneccessary sort changes every patch
- Fix: Stats were not updated immediatly
- Updated AHK core to v2.1

v2.6
- Code structuring improved
- Added new Option: Keys
	+ New Option: Key-rebindings for all Hotkey functions. Modifier keys supported.
	+ New Option: Toggle Passthrough keys - pressed keys will trigger functions and its key.
- Bugfix: progression option only updates on restart
- Minor code optimizations

v2.5
- Options overhaul, now more structured
- Added many new options. Currently, some lack implementation.
	+ Option: En-/Disable usage of DJMaxExcludeCharts.db
	+ Option: higher diff. charts are only available if lower diff. charts are excluded (F4)
	+ Option: Toggle StreamDeck support
- Error messages are a bit more useful now
- Minor code optimizations
- Finalizing some StreamDeck shaningans
- Added Arcaea DLC data
- Sorting reviewed and fixed
- 

- Usual DLC update. This time VL3.
- Added Filter options for CM/CV/PLI Packs. Access the menu by right-clicking on to the CM/CV/PLI Checkboxes
- Code refracturing
- fixed a small issue with CacheSongSelection
- Welcome message is back again :)
- CM/CV/PLI boxes are now able to be graychecked. This will visualize that some dlcpacks are disabled. Toggling them
	will enable/disable all dlcpacks in that category
- All submenus are now toggable
- Bitmaps are stored inside libraries. Currently I have to save the images into a real file. I'll look into it to skip this step
	until then everything is stored under the folder ./png
- Reworked some GUI elements
- Fixed a small issuen with the StreamDeck lib which resulted in continuues restarts